  "prefLabel": "Ins 204.03 Right to Counsel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 204.03 Right to Counsel. Any party in a proceeding may be represented by counsel. Parties shall retain counsel at their own expense and requests for appointment of counsel shall not be granted.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ins 200) #13073-A, eff 7-27-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins200.html"
